<h2 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #0f172a; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px;">Hello {{clientName}},</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Please find attached our quotation <strong>{{quoteNumber}}</strong> for <strong>{{title}}</strong>.</p>

<div style="background-color: #f8fafc; padding: 16px; border-left: 4px solid {{brand.accent}}; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5;">
  <strong style="color: #334155;">Quotation Number:</strong> {{quoteNumber}}<br>
  <strong style="color: #334155;">Subject:</strong> {{title}}<br>
  <strong style="color: #334155;">Valid Until:</strong> {{validUntil}}
</div>

<p style="margin: 0 0 8px 0;">Please review the quotation details in the attached PDF. You can also view, accept, or reject the quotation directly in the client portal using the button below.</p>
